# qwen3.6 35B-A3B with a 32k context and temperature 0: AutoMC's default local model from 2026-10-26, with the 128k variant
# kept selectable. Same parameters as the Control Room Agent's 32k recipe of 2026-10-21; only num_ctx differs from the 128k recipe.
#
# Build it once, in the Ollama that AutoMC talks to (the WSL one by default), from AutoMC/src:
#   ollama create qwen3.6:35b-32k-t0 -f config/ollama/qwen3.6-35b-32k-t0.Modelfile
#
# FROM must name the base model as that Ollama has it ('ollama list'): qwen3.6:35b-a3b in the WSL Ollama, qwen3.6:35b in the
# Windows one. 32k leaves about 23k tokens for the conversation after AutoMC's system prompt and tool schemas (about 9.2k); Ollama
# drops the oldest context silently when it is full, so the agent needs a context guard at this size.
FROM qwen3.6:35b-a3b

PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER min_p 0
PARAMETER presence_penalty 1.5
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1
